# A call the process crashes in before any of its writes reaches the device leaves nothing, and
# every call acknowledged before it stays. `crash after 0` crashes the process at its next device
# op, the call's first, before that op completes.
use dump-app

crash after 0

run
  insert users { name: "cy" }

reopen

query rowsort
  from u in users select u.name
----
"ann"
"bo"
